5526f21c07acc365ddddb7b83822bf8fafeb04a36eb6","logical_entry_identity":"b99406c3f3bb9f7b1f2dc1457a9cb504744e4990d063903890b52e412bf63212","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"internment camp correspondence (1)","source_tag":"_t","target":"拘留营信件 (1)"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"15a2ef295941ea37c59c805ede03489f776e9bef70fbcef18390fb0a8ea9091f","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"1a169eb70f72954eb8032ace733feaaba1895b9767df00c5b059f41efe2b51d0","logical_entry_identity":"c0eaac3c2ea17b83cf8d194de932324b9e0a43f9f1ea42b7f0e3891dbfc1497c","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"You took everything from me.  You took the dawn of a beautiful future, you took the fires of hope and happiness, you took the kind, guiding light of my love Aeryn and put out the glow of the life we deserved to have together.  The light is gone...  but you have given me darkness in return.  And you're about to know that darkness very, very well.  Embracing it fully rather than shutting it out...  It's so easy to use these powers now.  I've felt them before, but I had no hate to use as their inspiration, no true misery to pour into the minds deserving, no empty void inside me to drain your hopes and confidence into.  You've fixed that for me.\n\nMy heart still beats, but you have taken my life nonetheless.  You'll understand shortly.","source_tag":"_t","target":"你夺走了我的一切。你夺走了美好未来的曙光，你夺走了希望与幸福的火种，你夺走了我挚爱艾琳身上那善良的指引之光，熄灭了我们本该共同拥有的生命光辉。光芒已逝……但你回报给我的是黑暗。而你马上就会对这黑暗了如指掌。全盘接纳它而非拒之门外……现在运用这些力量是如此轻而易举。我以前就感受过它们，但我当时没有仇恨作为灵感，没有真正的痛苦倾注进那些应得之人的心灵，胸中也没有空洞来吸干你们的希望与信心。是你帮我补全了这一切。\n\n我的心脏仍在跳动，但你依然夺走了我的生命。你很快就会明白的。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"fec79f1447b57deda92c7c8b6cb80b9b99868781fe29b72512d7bb505c032155","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"1a19fcbadce125c11965be35756bd2f4a53053dfffc94b7b07a4c5fc1c75a553","logical_entry_identity":"dfc862543d1ef63978616f651920d7fbb9364f81b70d5ceb3efeb47a9df0571c","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"You can only cast this spell after casting an other technomancy spell.","source_tag":"logPlayer","target":"你只能在施放其他科技法术后施放此法术。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"146ba7ddb34b86acbb6acb3b690f6a0d3a83f29e1283b42a80c9270614e42f3a","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"1a31a769846e05e6d18434970da7a72d4036a7cb2ee2252bedcecdd93342804b","logical_entry_identity":"e032a2283c0e01a48d5626db4de5bfc9a0ea284a154a09290d59cf78e4921015","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"The life support suit allows using therapeutics with %d%% efficiency and cooldown mod of %d%%.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"生命支持服能以 %d%% 的效率使用药物，冷却时间修正为 %d%%。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"836f5845d9e0d2760e48be0e4085f835f8d81e5f46b2959f5cf17e694aa1edad","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"1a3afe0c06ffacd3cba18bc7d13ea41f4ca5bf06810f93de8315681aad9215c1","logical_entry_identity":"81c221f21b8ba3d1333d5ba3896da9db620b49953f71314dfe523615bbfa7039","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Ring of Lost Love","source_tag":"entity name","target":"逝爱指环"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"7fa6d3bfc26045f99a85038402cc54e3dd1c7536d2560b7b2674e71791e2bbfc","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"1a4baa38a49b584f2745cd9d0535eb4abc92f42f65a3135ee4d5c51dcd44f3a7","logical_entry_identity":"4f4787f7129dee6a1c13655de0d014b1f60e7071a23357eed33a265b07763212","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"This eight legged mechanical construct looks suspiciously like a spider. It seems to be more concerned by its fellow arachnids than by you.","source_tag":"_t","target":"这是个看上去很像蜘蛛的八腿机械构造体。比起你，它似乎更关心它的同胞们。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1738cde91cb974c610de091935b1985e1f6ff1eea8a7fb131834d595f141d36d","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"1a4ff5c8cb7da086cac0abd4e7a1b8c8aa627cd5262aaf3e644388af7bd76967","logical_entry_identity":"e9ad0a2bb4381da6b2711549a2e2ed58a63c1a55f5cf6c0bff50a68f0fd219b8","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"long barreled gun","source_tag":"_t","target":"长管蒸汽枪"},{"args_order":